      ],
      "date_text": "8 Oct - 20 Dec 2026",
      "description": "<p>\n\n          This autumn, the Garden Museum will hold contemporary German artist Sabine Moritz’s first UK museum exhibition. Reflecting on her childhood in East Germany, Moritz explores memories and encounters with the natural world through richly textured sketches and canvases, the majority of which have not been exhibited before.\n        </p>\n<p>\n\n          <p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Several of the works in this exhibition draw on Moritz’s recollections of growing up in Neulobeda, a satellite town filled with concrete-slab housing, where her family moved following the death of her father. </span>Dealing with grief, Moritz searched for solace beyond the city, exploring the surrounding hills and countryside.</p>\n<p><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134715312 BCX8\">Moritz now lives and works in Cologne. She keeps</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134715312 BCX8\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134715312 BCX8\">potted plants and </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134715312 BCX8\">vases of&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134715312 BCX8\">fresh&nbsp;</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134715312 BCX8\">flowers, which </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134715312 BCX8\">inspire her ongoing series of floral </span><span class=\"FindHit SCXW134715312 BCX8\">sti</span><span class=\"FindHit SCXW134715312 BCX8\">ll&nbsp;</span><span class=\"FindHit SCXW134715312 BCX8\">life</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW134715312 BCX8\"> paintings. In recent years, she has also </span>explored relationships with the natural world through an almost total abstraction, demonstrated in a vast piece created especially for this exhibition.</p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Moritz, whose work was described by curator Hans Ulrich Obrist in 2013 as “memories made visual – the fleeting impulses of the past rendered concrete in art”, has been widely exhibited in group and solo exhibitions in D</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">ü</span><span data-contrast=\"auto\">sseldorf, Brussels, Paris and London.</span></p>\n<p><em>This exhibition is supported by <a href=\"https://www.pilarcorrias.com/\">Pilar Corrias</a>.</em></p>\n\n        </p>",
      "image_url": "https://www.gardenmuseum.org.uk/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/SML00034-1024x783.jpg",
      "listing_is_free": false,
      "location": "Garden Museum",
      "title": "Sabine Moritz: Lie Down in Green Pastures",
      "types": [
        "exhibitions"
      ],
      "url": "https://www.gardenmuseum.org.uk/whats-on/sabine-moritz/"
    },
    "slug": "sabine-moritz"
